research/datasets/README.md
# Legibility Office Institutional Datasets

## Purpose

This directory contains structured datasets supporting research on the Institutional Operating System (IOS).

The datasets are intended for research, benchmarking, policy analysis, and institutional capability assessment.

---

# Dataset Categories

## Governance

Measures institutional quality.

Examples

- Government Effectiveness
- Rule of Law
- Regulatory Quality
- Voice and Accountability

---

## Procurement

Measures procurement capability.

Examples

- Tender Performance
- Contract Delivery
- Supplier Risk
- Procurement Integrity

---

## Digital Public Infrastructure

Measures digital capability.

Examples

- Digital Identity
- Payments
- Interoperability
- Digital Government

---

## Public Finance

Examples

- Budget Execution
- Revenue
- Debt
- Fiscal Performance

---

## Institutional Capability

Examples

- Coordination
- Institutional Memory
- Execution
- Capability Scores

---

## AI Governance

Examples

- AI Readiness
- AI Regulation
- Responsible AI
- AI Risk

---

## Countries

Country implementation datasets supporting IOS benchmarking.

---

## Development Finance

Institutional datasets from

- World Bank
- African Development Bank
- UNDP
- OECD
- IMF

---

## Vision

Create the world's largest open institutional capability dataset.
